==Battleground==
*1 [[Camelle]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*7 [[Croco]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*13 [[Croco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 12~15.33 seconds<sup>360f~460f</sup>.
*4 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*8 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*8 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Camelle is annoying to fight using Labyrinth fodder, but there's no real pushing power. Spam stuff with a little caution and you should win.

